# this_morning.set -- ROBOT NEKO ep 16 (SINCE THIS MORNING). The club's floor again, two lights, and
# marks for two bodies that can WALK now (w_walk, authored this morning): she walks in from x_in to x0,
# he walks from c0 to the lane, rides it, and walks back. Yaw, measured (ep 15): 0 faces -x, 90 faces
# -z, 180 faces +x, 270 faces +z. Image up = +z.
light  -3.0  3.2  -5.0   1.00 0.86 0.70   4.5  5.0
light   4.0  2.6 -12.0   0.55 0.65 1.00   3.0  6.0
mark  x_in    7.0  0  -8.5     0
mark  x0      1.7  0  -8.5     0
mark  c0     -1.3  0  -8.5   180
mark  lane0  -6.0  0 -13.0   180
mark  lane1   5.0  0 -13.0   180
mark  x_out   8.0  0  -5.0   270
route lane lane0 lane1
